  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kompetensh&#xf6;jn domstolar</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training Latvian judges</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to enable the Latvian courts to perform its duties with greater quality and efficiency by increasing the competence of Latvian judges in Civil Law, EC Law, international conventions etc. A group of 25 judges will be trained in order to be able to function as trainers at the Latvian Judicial Training Centre in education programmes for Latvian judges.</narrative>
  </description>
